        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Kickboxer: Vengeance\n- People: John Stockwell, Alain Moussi, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Dave Bautista, Gina Carano, Georges St-Pierre, Darren Shahlavi, David Michael Bautista Jr.\n- Topics: martial arts films, professional wrestling, mixed martial arts, bodybuilding\n\nFacts:\n- David Michael Bautista Jr. was born on January 18, 1969.\n- David Michael Bautista Jr. is an American actor, semi-retired professional wrestler, former mixed martial artist, and bodybuilder.\n- Kickboxer: Vengeance is a 2016 American martial arts film directed by John Stockwell.\n- Kickboxer: Vengeance stars Alain Moussi, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Dave Bautista, Gina Carano, Georges St-Pierre, and Darren Shahlavi.\n- Jean-Claude Van Damme played Kurt Sloane in the original Kickboxer film series.\n- Darren Shahlavi appeared in Kickboxer: Vengeance in his final film role.",
